OL,3,GNEWSA'You're living with this grief of
OL,4,Awatching your child regress'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother whose daughter was diagnosed
OL,7,Fwith a rare degenerative condition has
OL,8,Fopened up about the grief of watching
OL,9,Fher little girl regress in front of her
OL,10,Feyes.
OL,12,FMabel, now aged seven, was diagnosed
OL,13,Fthree years ago with Batten disease -
OL,14,Fan incurable illness which affects the
OL,15,Fnervous system, causing seizures,
OL,16,Fvisual impairment, mobility loss and
OL,17,Fearly death.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
