OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1791613572
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'You're living with this grief of
OL,4,Awatching your child regress'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's like having a baby, but you're
OL,7,Fgoing backwards, so you're not watching
OL,8,Fthem grow up, you're watching them
OL,9,Fregress," said her mother Cheryl, who
OL,10,Fwants to raise awareness about the
OL,11,Fcondition.
OL,13,FMabel, from Thornton in Lancashire, was
OL,14,Fborn in May 2019 but it was only when
OL,15,Fshe was about 18 months old that
OL,16,Fconcerns began to be raised.
